zappy:'<span id=zappy class=spanish_text>alegre</span> <div class=in_english><span>English&gt;&gt;</span> People should be <b>zappy</b> in life</div><div class=in_spanish><span>Spanish&gt;&gt;</span> La gente debería ser <b>alegre</b> en la vida.</div>',
