zilch:'<span id=zilch class=spanish_text>nada de nada</span> <div class=in_english><span>English&gt;&gt;</span> The government is treating its people like <b>zilch</b></div><div class=in_spanish><span>Spanish&gt;&gt;</span> El gobierno trata a su gente como <b>nada</b></div>',
